OL,3,GNEWSAThe table tennis group giving hope
OL,4,Ato players with Parkinson's
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor George Chan, everyday life can feel
OL,7,Fdifficult. Since he was diagnosed with
OL,8,Fthe progressive neurological condition
OL,9,FParkinson's, he sometimes struggles to
OL,10,Ftie his shoelaces and cut up food.
OL,12,F"It's a slightly undignified disease to
OL,13,Fhave," he says.
OL,15,F"You get quite introverted at times and
OL,16,Fyou lose your confidence."
OL,18,FBut when he plays table tennis, all
OL,19,Fthat melts away.
